# Context

## Background
The external review of 0b22357 listed three priorities. Two already
had tasks (T066 untrusted-pattern bounds, T069 one stateful task
through the public CLI); the third, usefulness on an API owned
outside this project, had none. The review also asked for an
independent conformance corpus over the declared Draft 2020-12
subset, which T040 never covered: T040 checked OpenAPI documents,
not the JSON Schema test suite.

## Why This Way
T072 is unblocked and independent of the stateful work; it hardens
the measurement layer everything else reports through. T073 depends
on T069 so the external validation runs against a validated
environment instead of contract-only fixtures.
